# Show deleted objects
ldapsearch -H ldap://$TARGET -D "$USER@$DOMAIN" -w "$PASSWORD" -b "DC=DOMAIN,DC=LOCAL" -E '1.2.840.113556.1.4.417' "(isDeleted=TRUE)"
# Show recycled objects
ldapsearch -H ldap://$TARGET -D "$USER@$DOMAIN" -w "$PASSWORD" -b "DC=DOMAIN,DC=LOCAL" -E '1.2.840.113556.1.4.2064' "(isDeleted=TRUE)"
# Query RootDSE naming contexts anonymously
ldapsearch -x -H "ldap://$DC_IP" -s base -b "" "(objectClass=*)" namingContexts
# Query all RootDSE attributes anonymously
ldapsearch -x -H "ldap://$DC_IP" -s base -b "" "(objectClass=*)" "*" "+"
# Attempt an anonymous domain search (requires anonymous LDAP operations and suitable ACLs)
ldapsearch -H ldap://$TARGET -x -b "DC=DOMAIN,DC=LOCAL"
# Search the domain with a simple bind
ldapsearch -H ldap://$TARGET -x -D "$USER@$DOMAIN" -w "$PASSWORD" -b "DC=DOMAIN,DC=LOCAL" "(objectClass=*)"
